        Which Way Does Time <span class="search-hit mathjax">Flow</span>? A Psychophysics-Grounded Evaluation for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
