        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Embodied</span> Intelligence for Advanced Bioinspired Microrobotics: Examples and Insights
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Perez-Arancibia%2C+N+O">Nestor O. Perez-Arancibia</a>
      
