    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        A Survey on Efficient <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-Action <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+Z">Zhaoshu Yu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+B">Bo Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zeng%2C+P">Pengpeng Zeng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+H">Haonan Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+J">Ji Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Z">Zheng Wang</a>, 
      
