    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        ViPER: Empowering the Self-Evolution of Visual Perception Abilities in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span>
      
