        Enabling Near-realtime Remote Sensing via Satellite-Ground Collaboration of Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
